## Metrics Subpackages

### `metrics/temperature/` — group-level temperature checks
Each function takes pre-loaded DataFrames and returns `{"metric_name": str, "pass_metric": bool | None, ...}`.

| File | ID | Role in temperature_health_rule |
|---|---|---|
| `ambient_temperature_volatility.py` | ATV | **Mandatory gate** |
| `ambient_stability.py` | R1 | Scored |
| `ambient_range.py` | R2 | Scored |
| `bucket_reference_adherence.py` | R3 | **Mandatory gate** |
| `sensor_spread_within_bucket.py` | R4 | Scored |
| `bucket_temporal_stability.py` | R5 | **Mandatory gate** |
| `small_hive_ambient_tracking.py` | R6a | Scored |
| `large_hive_thermoregulation.py` | R6b | Scored |
| `bucket_temperature_ordering.py` | R6c | Scored |
| `bucket_diurnal_amplitude.py` | R7 | **Mandatory gate** |

### `metrics/triage_rules/` — signals for Calibration Review Triage
Each function takes pre-loaded DataFrames and returns `{"metric_name": str, "pass_metric": bool | None, ...}`.

| File | Signal | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `clipping_diff.py` | A | Raw vs clipped prediction gap |
| `inspection_discrepancy.py` | B | Inspector count vs model output |
| `thermoreg_dipping.py` | C | Yards with rising temperature dispersion (14d) |
| `auto_review_score.py` | D | Composite UBF stability score (21d) |
| `thermoreg_dipping_7d.py` | C (7d) | 7-day variant of Signal C |
| `auto_review_score_7d.py` | D (7d) | 7-day variant of Signal D |

